('7d506d3a69f780babe78a3087df986cd','Hitung dari kurung terdalam: (* 4 7) = 28, lalu pakai hasilnya pada operasi luar bersama 2. Notasi prefix: operator ditulis lebih dulu.','Work from the innermost parentheses: (* 4 7) = 28, then use that result in the outer operation together with 2. Prefix notation: the operator comes first.'),
